/// maximum individual operand lengths admitted by fresh scope comparison;
/// `scope_fingerprint_comparison_bytes` is the complete queue-plus-supplied
/// byte census for both comparisons. Recursive integer-system entries report
/// their full retained comparison ceilings because that child does not yet
/// expose an equal-pair unit/bit census; recursive child-owned byte statistics
/// stop at that seam.
